# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings are normalised to LF inside the repository.
#
# The app deploys to Linux hosts (Render) and the Python service, Dockerfile and
# render.yaml are all consumed by Linux tooling, where CRLF causes confusing
# failures. Committing LF and checking out LF keeps everyone byte-identical;
# Windows developers are unaffected (git is line-ending agnostic for text).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.svg  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated lockfile: keep it stable and out of diffs.
package-lock.json text eol=lf -diff
